    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2605600/extras/6175fb54be185573049ebac7bf6c5bcf.poster.avif?t=1727470377\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2605600/extras/6175fb54be185573049ebac7bf6c5bcf.webm?t=1727470377\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2605600/extras/6175fb54be185573049ebac7bf6c5bcf.mp4?t=1727470377\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Facehand is a synergy-driven roguelike deckbuilder where you chain card abilities to create wild combos.</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2605600/extras/752e3976c4dbab320f887048561b72d3.poster.avif?t=1727470377\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2605600/extras/752e3976c4dbab320f887048561b72d3.webm?t=1727470377\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2605600/extras/752e3976c4dbab320f887048561b72d3.mp4?t=1727470377\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Theorycraft the strongest hand possible to break the game<br></li><li>Ascending Grade system constantly adds new twists<br></li><li>Unlockables add new content as you progress</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2605600/extras/9d407b43d6597774a29656f373fbe2e6.poster.avif?t=1727470377\" width=616 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2605600/extras/9d407b43d6597774a29656f373f